1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:06,500
New managers are expected to handle difficult feedback
before they have ever practiced saying it.

2
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:12,900
ReplayLead makes the real conversation
your second attempt, not your first.

3
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:19,900
I start with a realistic workplace scenario
and record how prepared I feel.

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:27,300
The goal: name the impact, understand what happened,
and agree on a concrete recovery plan.

5
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:33,700
This is active rehearsal. I write the words
I would actually use, and the counterpart reacts.

6
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:40,600
Advice becomes practice,
not another article to read.

7
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:47,600
Rewind returns to a specific moment
and starts a true alternate branch.

8
00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:55,700
I can replace a vague response with clearer evidence,
curiosity, support, and a concrete next step.

9
00:00:56,100 --> 00:01:03,500
ReplayLead scores clarity, empathy,
assertiveness, and actionability.

10
00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:11,800
It gives a focused improvement and stronger language.
The confidence check makes the change visible.

11
00:01:12,100 --> 00:01:18,800
RevenueCat powers ReplayLead Pro.
The paywall loads the live localized annual price.

12
00:01:18,900 --> 00:01:26,500
Entitlement verification and user-triggered restore
unlock ReplayLead Pro on this account.

13
00:01:26,800 --> 00:01:33,500
For Shipaton, the purchase flow was verified end to end
with RevenueCat Test Store.

14
00:01:33,600 --> 00:01:41,200
It is a simulated transaction, so we do not claim
real revenue or a production store sale.

15
00:01:41,500 --> 00:01:47,200
ReplayLead: practice the hard conversation,
rewind the moment, and lead it better.
